{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017TfXQPTQ18yHgvTGupds89","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"853b0b67c5077cf60319578787ca444d20e4cb07\",\"date\":\"2026-06-16T18:30:32-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#2585)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"2c885385dab90d3d70665b7f939184e5bf712b47\",\"date\":\"2026-06-16T18:23:28+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) Average wait time card never fetches data (#2320)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"useAverageWaitTime was called with an empty string for statusUuid.\\nThe hook skips the API call when statusUuid is falsy, so the card\\nalways showed '--'. Passing defaultStatusConceptUuid from config\\ninstead, same as waiting-patients.extension.tsx already does.\",\"authorName\":\"SHUBHANGI SINGH\",\"authorEmail\":\"singhhshubhangii@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"ec20608aebe7662d3744511e4f9e9491463d9601\",\"date\":\"2026-06-16T18:19:53+05:30\",\"message\":\"(chore) O3-5642: Enforce strict equality rule (eqeqeq) across patient management (#2521)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Sathieskumar Sudeshkar\",\"authorEmail\":\"sudeshkar008sk@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e2c8e98c232fc9ae22748fb045eac62afb6bff8d\",\"date\":\"2026-06-12T13:06:14+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5736: Center align clear queue entries button and filter status dropdown in the toolbar (#2580)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Souravjyoti Dutta\",\"authorEmail\":\"148575647+sourav-jyoti@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"c91be8869df78eccdf0e8149c234cc634100899c\",\"date\":\"2026-06-10T18:27:45-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#2575)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"9ab280192e260ec8eee5dc7c3f6d90ba95da7508\",\"date\":\"2026-06-10T04:00:02-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Release v11.0.0 (#2573)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"7251e36ba65dc9f0154009b89eb0a84db37ac85a\",\"date\":\"2026-06-10T15:39:03+08:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5665: Fix vitals form and triage form not opening (#2540)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) launch vitals and triage forms inline in service queues\\n\\n* translation changes\\n\\n* fixup\\n\\n* fixup: drop redundant visitContext from notes workspace launch\\n\\n* (fix) Address feedback\\n\\nMatch obs by concept UUID, isolate patient group props in a dedicated workspace group, rename triage-note to visit-note, and single-source workspace names.\\n\\n* (fix) Match obs by concept UUID behind a configurable visitNoteEncounterTypeUuid guard.\\n\\n* chore: update translations\\n\\n* chore: update translations\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: jwnasambu <33891016+jwnasambu@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org>\\nCo-authored-by: NethmiRodrigo <nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Ujjawal Prabhat\",\"authorEmail\":\"UjjawalPrabhat1@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"be584598fad189fb46c7d7da99dfa43617cb9cb3\",\"date\":\"2026-06-09T17:31:41+05:30\",\"message\":\"(chore) Bump @openmrs/esm-framework peer dependency to 10.x (#2569)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"bcc8858ace12296865f68cc556ba3eabcfd34666\",\"date\":\"2026-06-09T19:11:32+08:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5683: Replace hardcoded SCSS colors with theme tokens (#2559)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) O3-5683: Replace hardcoded SCSS colors with theme tokens\\n\\n* Use -04 strong-border token for queue screen card\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org>\",\"authorName\":\"Ujjawal Prabhat\",\"authorEmail\":\"UjjawalPrabhat1@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"49a93f006e49b88e2c8a607f2a9946d2ec22e344\",\"